        <activityName xml:lang="en">Transport, coal freight, rail</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Transport, coal freight, rail
Based on homonymous dataset for RER, but requirement for specific CN operation transport dataset. However, due to doubts on the functional unit of the used official Chinese statistics,and lack of independent verification, this dataset should not be used for comparisons of transport means across different countries but only when transport is not a major contributor to total environmental burdens of a process or product being analyzed.;
